- 关联位置 1: OpenAuth.Core/OpenAuth.App/HumanResource/Employees/JobAbilityApp.cs:1173:41-43 | +1
- 关联位置 2: OpenAuth.Core/OpenAuth.App/HumanResource/Employees/JobAbilityApp.cs:1177:13-15 | +1
- 关联位置 3: OpenAuth.Core/OpenAuth.App/HumanResource/Employees/JobAbilityApp.cs:1194:13-20 | +1
